// Liquid Glass for niri - DISABLED.
//
// Stock niri rejects the `liquid-glass` node outright ("unexpected node
// `liquid-glass`"), so including this on stock niri makes the whole config
// invalid and niri refuses to start. It only parses under niri-glass, which
// patches niri's own source
// glass/ holds the three presets, matching the hyprglass ones:
//   clear.kdl    ultra-clear end of the macOS 27 transparency slider
//   default.kdl  goldengate
//   tinted.kdl   frosted end
//
// The menu switcher rewrites the include line below, so keep it on one line and
// keep the commented form exactly as it is.

// include "glass/default.kdl"
